## 3. Bagian B — Modul Baru: Environment Management (`http://k3.localhost/modules/environment/`)

### 3.1 Penempatan Menu di Sidebar Dashboard K3
Menambahkan menu baru di `dashboard-k3/includes/sidebar.php` dengan ikon **Leaf / Environment**:
- **Environment Management**
  - `Sustainability Dashboard` (`modules/environment/index.php`)
  - `Waste Management (Pemilahan 10%)` (`modules/environment/index.php?tab=waste`)
  - `Energy & Water Monitoring` (`modules/environment/index.php?tab=energy_water`)
  - `Social Footprint & ESG` (`modules/environment/index.php?tab=social`)

### 3.2 6 Komponen Environmental Sustainability KPI (Sesuai Referensi Gambar)
Seluruh 6 panel dirancang dengan gaya modern Clean TERAS360 (mendukung **Default Table View** untuk input/CRUD data real & **Dashboard / Advanced 3D View** untuk visualisasi grafik):

| # | Panel / Metrik | Visualisasi Grafik | Parameter Data (CRUD per Proyek & Periode) |
| :-: | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **1** | **Energy (kWh)** | Bar Chart 3 Kategori | `Scope 1` (BBM/Genset/Alat), `Scope 2` (Listrik PLN/Site), `Scope 3` (Transportasi/Supply Chain) |
| **2** | **Waste (tons / kg)** | Bar Chart 5 Kategori + Indikator Pemilahan 10% | `Miscellaneous`, `General`, `Recyclable`, `Clinical`, `Hazardous / Waste` + **Checklist & Volume Pemilahan Sampah Domestik (10%)** yang terhubung langsung ke Safety KPI! |
| **3** | **Water (Kilolitres)** | Bar Chart 4 Kategori | `Total Withdrawals`, `Total Recycling`, `Total Discharges`, `Total Refuses` |
| **4** | **Material Flow** | Doughnut Chart Rasio (%) | `Inflow (%)` vs `Outflow (%)` (volume material masuk vs keluar/sisa/daur ulang) |
| **5** | **Social Footprint** | Tabel Inisiatif & Biaya | `Type of Community Development` (*Sustainable Enterprise, Knowledge & Skills, Infrastructure, Human Resource Development*) & `Initiative Cost (Rp)` |
| **6** | **Sustainability Manager** | Doughnut Chart Proporsi ESG | Proporsi program `Environment`, `Labour Practices`, dan `Social` |

### 3.3 Mode Tampilan Environment Management
- **Default View: Table & Data Management** — Memudahkan tim HSE/Site untuk melakukan **Tambah, Edit, Hapus** data Waste (termasuk input laporan Pemilahan Sampah Domestik 10% per Safety Officer), Energy, Water, Material Flow, dan Social Footprint.
- **Dashboard & Advanced 3D View** — Menampilkan seluruh 6 panel grafik interaktif (2D Chart.js sesuai gambar referensi + toggle **3D Interactive View** via Plotly WebGL untuk presentasi manajemen).

